{"67e7453b-9ee5-4ae5-9316-215b03e4a71d":{"id":"67e7453b-9ee5-4ae5-9316-215b03e4a71d","title":"Tongari Boushi no Atelier","altTitle":"Witch Hat Atelier","description":"In a world where everyone takes wonders like magic spells and dragons for granted, Coco is a girl with a simple dream: she wants to be a wizard. But everybody knows magicians are born, not made, and she was not born with a gift for magic. Resigned to her un-magical life, Coco is about to give up on her dream until the day she meets Qifrey, a mysterious traveling magician. After secretly watching him perform magic in a way she's never seen before, Coco soon learns what everybody \"knows\" might not be the truth and discovers that her magical dream may not be as far away as it seems...\n___  \n- Winner of the 2020 Eisner Award for Best U.S. Edition of International Material-Asia.  \n- Winner of the Best Manga award at the 2020 Harvey Awards.\n___\n**Officially licensed:**  \n- In English by [Kodansha](https://kodansha.us/series/witch-hat-atelier/) as *Witch Hat Atelier*\n- Indonesian by [Elex Media](https://elexmedia.id/detail/produk/Atelier-of-Witch-Hat-01/9786020458892/pencarian) as *Atelier of Witch Hat*\n- In German by [Egmont Manga](https://www.egmont-manga.de/series/Atelier%20of%20Witch%20Hat) as *Atelier of Witch Hat*\n- In Spanish by [Milky Way Ediciones](https://www.milkywayediciones.com/collections/all/atelier-of-witch-hat) as *Atelier of Witch Hat: El Atelier de Sombreros de Mago*\n- In French by [Pika](https://www.pika.fr/serie/latelier-des-sorciers) as *L'Atelier des Sorciers* \n- In Italian by [Panini Comics](https://www.panini.it/shp_ita_it/atelier-of-witch-hat-1-matel001isbn-it08.html) as *Atelier of Witch Hat*\n- In Brazilian Portuguese by [Panini Comics](https://loja.panini.com.br/panini/produto/Manga-Atelier-of-Witch-Hat-1.aspx) as *Atelier of Witch Hat*\n- In Polish by [Kotori](http://kotori.pl/nasze-wydania/atelier-spiczastych-kapeluszy/) as *Atelier spiczastych kapeluszy*\n- In Russian by [Истари Комикс](https://istari.ru/katalog-knig/manga/istari-comics/atel_e_koldovskih_kolpakov/) as *Ателье колдовских колпаков*  \n- In Ukrainian by [Nasha Idea](https://nashaidea.com/product/ateliye-chaklunskih-kapeluhiv-tom1/) as *Ательє чаклунських капелюхів*\n- In Korean by Haksan Media as *고깔모자의 아틀리에*","year":2016,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/67e7453b-9ee5-4ae5-9316-215b03e4a71d/a9feeb2a-4b34-4a52-93fb-ab948e743503.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["my","fr","fa","es-la","pt-br","en","ru","ar","it","ca","id"],"lane":"manga","rating":9.47,"follows":80239,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:05:15.309Z","chapters":[{"id":"829aa69e-cafe-4550-92fe-c736f75e586e","number":"47","volume":"9","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":28,"createdAt":"2026-08-12T06:42:43+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8564d0a4-e1f6-4f45-811a-d4af4bb98c31","number":"46","volume":"9","title":null,"lang":"id","pages":23,"createdAt":"2026-07-30T09:13:47+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:27:04.134Z"},"13d2856e-9163-43a1-86f9-cd66d41db09b":{"id":"13d2856e-9163-43a1-86f9-cd66d41db09b","title":"Isekai Samurai","altTitle":"Samurai in Another World","description":"The strongest swordsman of the Warring States period, transferred to another world.\n\nAt the end of the Warring States Period, Ginko, the greatest swordsman of the time, was always hungry for a fight to the death with someone stronger than herself. After cutting and cutting and cutting, she finally despairs that there is no one stronger than her in this world, and then she is transferred to another world! Before her eyes - a dragon!\n\n**Award:** Won the Traditional Chinese Global Special Award in the Web category of the 2024 Next Manga Awards.\n___\n**Alt Official Raw:** [niconico Manga](https://manga.nicovideo.jp/comic/62456)","year":2023,"status":"ongoing","lastC